OL,3,GNEWSAEHCP delays see county's schools
OL,4,Amiss out on #7.3m
OL,5,
OL,6,FDelays in assessing children with
OL,7,Fspecial educational needs and
OL,8,Fdisabilities (SEND) cost a county's
OL,9,Fmainstream schools an estimated #7.3m
OL,10,Fin a year.
OL,12,FCambridgeshire County Council said a
OL,13,Fbacklog of about 1,800 children waiting
OL,14,Ffor education, health and care plans
OL,15,F(EHCPs) meant funding was not being
OL,16,Freleased to schools.
OL,18,FLess than one in 10 EHCPs, the legal
OL,19,Fdocuments setting out a pupil's needs
OL,20,Fand what support they should receive,
OL,21,Fwere being completed on time in the
OL,22,Fcounty.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
